# The Credential Manager matcher is a WebAssembly binary. Git's own heuristic
# would classify it correctly today (a .wasm starts with a NUL byte), but that is
# the default behaving well rather than a rule, and the moment anyone adds a
# blanket `* text` line it would be rewritten on checkout and rejected by the
# platform's WASM runtime with nothing naming the cause.
*.wasm binary
